WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.540
In <00:00:00.080>the <00:00:00.160>spring <00:00:00.360>of <00:00:00.580>nineteen <00:00:01.060>forty,

00:00:01.540 --> 00:00:02.720
Germany <00:00:02.060>turned <00:00:02.380>west.

00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:05.200
Denmark <00:00:03.700>and <00:00:04.080>Norway <00:00:04.320>fell <00:00:04.700>in <00:00:04.880>April.

00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:08.020
In <00:00:05.980>May, <00:00:06.520>German <00:00:06.780>armies <00:00:07.240>poured <00:00:07.640>into <00:00:07.900>the

00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:09.920
